{"id":"pacifique","lemma":"pacifique","pos":"adj","rank":3428,"glosses":["pacific"],"ipa":"/pa.si.fik/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e5/Fr-Pacifique.ogg/Fr-Pacifique.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"pacifiques"},"formAudio":{"pacifiques":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-pacifiques.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ce sont des personnes pacifiques.","en":"They are a peace-loving people.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"no one, nobody","l":"personne"},null]},{"text":"Nous survolons le Pacifique.","en":"We're flying over the Pacific.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nous volons au-dessus du Pacifique.","en":"We are flying over the Pacific.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to fly through the air","l":"voler"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Les manifestations de lundi étaient surtout pacifiques.","en":"Monday's protests were mostly peaceful.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"protest, demonstration","l":"manifestation"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"Monday"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"above all"},null]},{"text":"Ce fleuve se jette dans le Pacifique.","en":"That river flows into the Pacific.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"a river that flows into…"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to throw","l":"jeter"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}